ref=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E6%80%92%E7%84%B0%E5%BD%B1%E8%A2%AD\" title=\"技能图鉴库/怒焰影袭\"><font color=\"#FFF\">怒焰影袭</font></a></div>\n</div>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<p><br /><br /><br />\n</p>\n<table style=\"width:100%;text-align:left\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" class=\"wn_s_first_col\" style=\"background-color:#DCDCDC;text-align:center\"><big><big><b>门内可额外习得技能</b></big></big>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><br />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-6 col-md-6 col-lg-6\">\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:15%;\">极限解放\n</th>\n<td><div class=\"gx_box\">\n    <div data-type=\"@悬浮框/极限解放\" data-name=\"陷阵豪壮\" class=\"bili-tt gx_bg\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E8%A7%A3%E6%94%BE/%E9%99%B7%E9%98%B5%E8%B1%AA%E5%A3%AE\" title=\"极限解放/陷阵豪壮\"><img alt=\"技能背景 史诗.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/7/7b/bdxsswq2neqstneo43aobr0kisd0zoh.png/65px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%83%8C%E6%99%AF_%E5%8F%B2%E8%AF%97.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"65\" height=\"65\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/7/7b/bdxsswq2neqstneo43aobr0kisd0zoh.png/98px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%83%8C%E6%99%AF_%E5%8F%B2%E8%AF%97.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/7/7b/bdxsswq2neqstneo43aobr0kisd0zoh.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /></a></div>\n    <div data-type=\"@悬浮框/极限解放\" data-name=\"陷阵豪壮\" class=\"bili-tt gx_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E8%A7%A3%E6%94%BE/%E9%99%B7%E9%98%B5%E8%B1%AA%E5%A3%AE\" title=\"极限解放/陷阵豪壮\"><img alt=\"极限解放 陷阵豪壮.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/fb/3a3pfjl29rjanmyv05qbjhe36c54hun.png/65px-%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E8%A7%A3%E6%94%BE_%E9%99%B7%E9%98%B5%E8%B1%AA%E5%A3%AE.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"65\" height=\"65\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/fb/3a3pfjl29rjanmyv05qbjhe36c54hun.png/98px-%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E8%A7%A3%E6%94%BE_%E9%99%B7%E9%98%B5%E8%B1%AA%E5%A3%AE.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/f/fb/3a3pfjl29rjanmyv05qbjhe36c54hun.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /></a></div>\n    <div class=\"gx_name\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E8%A7%A3%E6%94%BE/%E9%99%B7%E9%98%B5%E8%B1%AA%E5%A3%AE\" title=\"极限解放/陷阵豪壮\"><font color=\"#FFF\">陷阵豪壮</font></a></div>\n    </div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:15%;\">关联内容\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-6 col-md-6 col-lg-6\">\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:left\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width: 75px;\">角色绰号\n</th>\n<td>龙虾、小龙虾\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width: 75px;\">配置推荐\n</th>\n<td>同下\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width: 75px;\">角色攻略\n</th>\n<td>【by超能缪缪】<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"http://game.bilibili.com/linkfilter/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.taptap.cn%2Fmoment%2F662265731995405490\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.taptap.cn/moment/662265731995405490</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-6 col-md-6 col-lg-6\">\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:left\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width: 75px;\">中文CV\n</th>\n<td>戴超行\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width: 75px;\">日文CV\n</th>\n<td>神奈延年\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width: 75px;\">配音展示\n</th>\n<td>【byThAmeReborn】<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV12K5kzJEkX\">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV12K5kzJEkX</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width: 75px;\">角色生平\n</th>\n<td>帕西法尔曾是承载了铁荆棘骑士团骄傲的骑士，年轻的他谦逊而英勇，心怀正义，珍视荣誉。所有人都相信，只需假以时日，这位骑士会接过他的父亲——时任铁荆棘骑士团团长手中的荆棘之剑，让铁荆棘的荣耀在那剑锋上永续。<br />铁荆棘骑士团在第二次光辉之战中践行了誓言。然而，在付出了惨痛代价、为同盟争取到最终的胜利后，得到的却只是军械库里堆积的染血勋章。此后，诸骑士团国在整合与分裂之间产生了严重的分歧。作为分裂派的强硬代表，铁荆棘骑士团与代表整合派的狮心骑士团已经形成了军事对峙的态势。<br />倘若两国爆发战争，诸骑士团国将重蹈两百年前的覆辙，陷入全面的内战。骑士们唯有掌握了强大而一致的、属于自己的力量，才能在战后波诡云谲的大陆上生存下去——抱着这样的信念，开战前夕，帕西法尔再次来到军营劝谏自己的父亲。无人知晓发生了什么，当骑士们赶到时，团长已被荆棘之剑贯穿胸膛，帕西法尔则不知所踪。<br />裁决王卡姆洛特借此机会彻底压制了分裂势力，完成了骑士同盟重组。当帕西法尔再次出现在人们面前时，已是裁决王身旁，身着鲜血咒铠“法夫纳”的模样。被任命为铁荆棘骑士团新任团长的他不再与骑士们并肩作战，而是以求死般的扭曲姿态孤身穿行于战场。这诅咒或许正是背叛者的惩罚，但咒锺之下，那颗沐浴在鲜血中的破碎心脏，不曾忘记他许下的誓言，他战斗的理由，他以生命守护的东西——“荆棘缠绕我身”。\n</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261022152528\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\n[SMW] In‐text annotation parser time: 0 seconds\nCPU time usage: 0.272 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.505 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1754/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 52806/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7318/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 13/40\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 399/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  311.680      1 模板:角色\n100.00%  311.680      1 -total\n 57.08%  177.895      1 模板:技能树\n 47.42%  147.796     14 模板:技能图\n  6.00%   18.696      1 模板:面包屑\n  4.82%   15.035      1 模板:个性图\n  3.82%   11.916      1 模板:极限解放图\n  1.86%    5.793      1 模板:兵种图\n  1.75%    5.449      1 模板:立绘\n  0.79%    2.456      3 模板:阵营图\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key gamecenter_wiki_llzj-pre_:pcache:idhash:5778-0!dateformat=default and timestamp 20261022152528 and revision id 16274. Serialized with PHP.\n -->\n</div>","categories":[{"sortkey":"","category":"角色","missing":true},{"sortkey":"","category":"可邂逅角色","missing":true}],"images":["立绘_帕西法尔.png","立绘_帕西法尔（五星）.png","文字_传说.png","职业图标背景_毁灭者.png","职业图标_毁灭者.png","阵营图标_骑士同盟.png","阵营图标_漂泊者.png","阵营图标_锐疾如风.png","技能背景_史诗.png","个性_铁荆棘之誓.png","技能_无懈可击.png","技能背景_传说.png","技能_蚀魂形骸.png","技能_环斩.png","技能背景_卓越.png","技能_破甲击（剑）.png","技能_咒刃旋绞.png","技能_咒刃渊狱.png","技能_染血荆棘.png","技能_咒骂.png","技能_咒刃血戮.png","技能_玷污之镰.png","技能_骑